# Gemini Enhanced Ruleset for Clash / Mihomo
# Sources:
# - ACL4SSR Gemini.list (original core rules)
# - Google Workspace Admin: Gemini App firewall settings
#   https://knowledge.workspace.google.com/admin/generative-ai/gemini-app/gemini-app-firewall-settings
# Updated: 2026-11-06
#
# Notes:
# 1) This is a classical text ruleset: behavior: classical, format: text.
# 2) Google explicitly notes that some hosts below are shared with other Google services.
# 3) Ad / analytics hosts are intentionally separated and commented out at the bottom.

# ===== Gemini / Bard / AI Studio core =====
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bard.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativeai.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aistudio.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,makersuite.google.com
DOMAIN,ai.google.dev
DOMAIN,alkalimakersuite-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,proactivebackend-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativelanguage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,apis.google.com

# ===== Gemini web app: official documented dependencies =====
DOMAIN,lh5.googleusercontent.com
DOMAIN,www.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,ssl.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,fonts.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,play.google.com
DOMAIN,ogs.google.com
DOMAIN,www.google.com
DOMAIN,jnn-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,waa-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,i.ytimg.com
DOMAIN,yt3.ggpht.com
DOMAIN,lh3.googleusercontent.com
DOMAIN,maps.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,lh3.google.com
DOMAIN,csp.withgoogle.com
DOMAIN,www.youtube.com
DOMAIN,fonts.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,maps.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,www.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,optimizationguide-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,streetviewpixels-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,content-autofill.googleapis.com

# ===== Optional: ad / telemetry hosts listed by Google =====
# Enable these only if you specifically want these requests to use the Gemini proxy.
# They are not normally required for core chat functionality and may be shared with other sites.
# DOMAIN,ogads-pa.clients6.google.com
# DOMAIN,www.googletagmanager.com
# DOMAIN,static.doubleclick.net
# DOMAIN,td.doubleclick.net
# DOMAIN,googleads.g.doubleclick.net
# DOMAIN,www.google-analytics.com

# ===== Deliberately not included from the ACL4SSR original =====
# DOMAIN-KEYWORD,colab                 # Google Colab is a separate service
# DOMAIN-KEYWORD,developerprofiles     # Broad keyword match; not Gemini-specific
